load @term/seed/code/structure/ring
  find ring

# A scheme: the central object of modern algebraic geometry, a space glued from the spectra of commutative rings, where
# geometry and algebra become one, points are prime ideals and functions are ring elements. Schemes generalize varieties
# to allow nilpotents and to work over any ring. The form carries the ring the scheme is built from.
form scheme
  link ring, like ring
